Problem-space prior art
-----------------------
The general idea of a local-first VS Code dashboard that analyzes AI coding
assistant session logs was explored publicly by Microsoft’s “AI Engineer Coach”
project (MIT License): https://github.com/microsoft/ai-engineering-coach

Cadence is not a fork of that repository. Names, UI, architecture, packaging,
documentation, and source code in this repository are original. Cadence reads
the same kinds of on-disk session log formats that many AI coding tools already
write (JSONL / SQLite / chat session files). Those log formats are owned by
their respective tool vendors.

